"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Simple dishes cooked as they once were with quality ingredients, excellent pasta and tender meats. \"Real home cooking\" has become a rarity by now. Simple environment that pays more attention to the \"substance\" than to appearance but tidy and clean.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Marino"},{"id":"san_marino_wv_la_bettola","areaId":"san_marino","name":"La Bettola","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":43.93889,"lng":12.44662},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"san_marino_wv_la_bettola","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["labettola","sanmarino"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Great venue for small snacks or juicy sandwiches. Really good burger. Music and entertainment until late. Very knowledgeable and very friendly staff. Outdoor tables. In the historic center of Borgo Maggiore. Pleasant environment.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Marino"},{"id":"san_marino_wv_bar_trattoria_la_gara","areaId":"san_marino","name":"Bar Trattoria La Gara","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":43.96905,"lng":12.47899},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"san_marino_wv_bar_trattoria_la_gara","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["bartrattorialagara","sanmarino"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"It's like eating at home with food prepared by a great cook. Furnishings that are firmly in the 70s. Simple, home-cooked cuisine. Menu of the day with some alternatives. A genuine cuisine that strikes you straight to the heart.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Marino"},{"id":"san_marino_wv_good_fellas","areaId":"san_marino","name":"Good Fellas","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":43.97725,"lng":12.48652},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"san_marino_wv_good_fellas","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["goodfellas","sanmarino"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Very tasty food, the service is excellent and courteous. Excellent location that allows you to enjoy the view over the entire shopping center from above. Serves great coffee, breakfasts and lunches. Nice and simple.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Marino"},{"id":"san_marino_wv_pizzeria_millennium","areaId":"san_marino","name":"Pizzeria Millennium","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":43.98254,"lng":12.48985},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"san_marino_wv_pizzeria_millennium","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["pizzeriamillennium","sanmarino"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"One of the few good pizzerias in San Marino. Thin, digestible and with excellent quality ingredients. Excellent cuisine too. First courses not to be underestimated. Very kind. Excellent service. Informal atmosphere.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Marino"},{"id":"san_marino_wv_l_angela_veste_piada","areaId":"san_marino","name":"L'Angela Veste Piada","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":43.94585,"lng":12.45169},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"san_marino_wv_l_angela_veste_piada","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["langelavestepiada","sanmarino"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Nice and kind managers. The piada is excellent. Beautifully filled and delicious cassoni. Traditional, organic, new, but all strictly high quality. Very nice and helpful staff. Try potato, truffle and mozzarella.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Marino"},{"id":"san_marino_wv_pizzeria_smaller","areaId":"san_marino","name":"Pizzeria Smaller","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":43.93394,"lng":12.4482},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"san_marino_wv_pizzeria_smaller","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["pizzeriasmaller","sanmarino"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Impeccable, very nice place, excellent cuisine. Also recommended to take away. Very nice and helpful staff. Slightly out of the hustle and bustle of the center and worth it. Very good cook, let him advise you.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:San Marino"},{"id":"san_marino_wv_ristorante_pizzeria_il_monte","areaId":"san_marino","name":"Ristorante Pizzeria Il Monte","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"la